# Working files for the deity-art scripts. `raw/` is 64 MB of downloads and
# `cand/` 38 MB of contact-sheet thumbnails — both re-fetch on demand.
#
# The candidate JSON is NOT ignored, deliberately: PICKS in
# deity-art-process.py indexes into those files by position, and Commons
# search results drift, so without them the indices point at different
# paintings and the pipeline is no longer reproducible.
raw/
cand/*.jpg
cand/*.png
deity-meta.json
preview-*.jpg
chart-preview.html
